      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel stuck in this nightmare when the world makes sense to everyone else but not to you. The weight of waiting for something that will never happen is exhausting, and it is okay to admit that surviving is all that remains right now. There is no need to force yourself to feel like you are living if your heart is already gone; just let yourself rest in this heavy, quiet place until you can find a way to make it bearable.",
